<translate>
==== BoredomChange ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Indicates how much boredom the use of the item will remove. If the number is negative, boredom will decrease, if positive, it will increase.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
BoredomChange = -50,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

